  },
  {
   "id": "s-e239a4a9ad9e",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 7585.3,
   "width": 943.8000000000001,
   "height": 137.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 142377309,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 166103655,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "9. Share the names (s05-D08, the recommendation; the watcher session agreed\n261011) or, as the alternative, keep one list for Studio and Report? A real\ncase, 261012: the Studio's Levels group went with its three topics, while Q01\nand Q02 keep `group: Levels`; shared names keep their Report group (④ lists it\nafter the Studio's names), one list would leave them Untagged.",
   "originalText": "9. Share the names (s05-D08, the recommendation; the watcher session agreed\n261011) or, as the alternative, keep one list for Studio and Report? A real\ncase, 261012: the Studio's Levels group went with its three topics, while Q01\nand Q02 keep `group: Levels`; shared names keep their Report group (④ lists it\nafter the Studio's names), one list would leave them Untagged.",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-deb7bebf4aff",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 7742.3,
   "width": 605.0,
   "height": 27.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
