   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1116595074,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1266112550,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "11. The starting groups of discovery, design and labeling are guesses: learn\nthem on one real Block each (s01's s09 Later 1 says the same).",
   "originalText": "11. The starting groups of discovery, design and labeling are guesses: learn\nthem on one real Block each (s01's s09 Later 1 says the same).",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-2994e48c5ca5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 7856.1,
   "width": 907.5000000000001,
   "height": 110.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1299771761,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 980179683,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "13. Each theme Block (b11 to b17) owns its theme's list? For the paper, yes\n(b16 s05-D02, proposed 261011): b10 keeps the rule and this table, b16 the\npaper's four groups and its standing Questions. The other six theme Blocks\nhave not answered.",
   "originalText": "13. Each theme Block (b11 to b17) owns its theme's list? For the paper, yes\n(b16 s05-D02, proposed 261011): b10 keeps the rule and this table, b16 the\npaper's four groups and its standing Questions. The other six theme Blocks\nhave not answered.",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-fe796a6d2fde",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1070,
   "y": 7371.7,
   "width": 931.7,
   "height": 192.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1862461353,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1713679900,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "14. Answered for the paper by b16 s05-D01 (proposed 261011): a Question's\n`group:` is its kind (Ideation, Narrative, or an asker: reviewer, coauthor,\neditor, reader). The telling is said once, in its **Feeds:** line (q00_ to\nq06_), so Research questions are the Questions it feeds, read by id; a\nresearch question needs no group line, and `nmi-cgm-scaling-axes` keeps\nworking unedited. b16 s05 Open 5 asks which name the screen keeps, RQ0 or Q00\n(JL's choice).",
   "originalText": "14. Answered for the paper by b16 s05-D01 (proposed 261011): a Question's\n`group:` is its kind (Ideation, Narrative, or an asker: reviewer, coauthor,\neditor, reader). The telling is said once, in its **Feeds:** line (q00_ to\nq06_), so Research questions are the Questions it feeds, read by id; a\nresearch question needs no group line, and `nmi-cgm-scaling-axes` keeps\nworking unedited. b16 s05 Open 5 asks which name the screen keeps, RQ0 or Q00\n(JL's choice).",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-7fd1fa2902cd",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1070,
   "y": 7585.9,
   "width": 931.7,
   "height": 82.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
