   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "15. An insight topic (Sleep; Variants, Timing): a `group:` line in each\nquestion.md's front matter in the Prototype, so every Board of that Prototype\nshares it? And agree the 12 SMS topic names (s05-D14).",
   "originalText": "15. An insight topic (Sleep; Variants, Timing): a `group:` line in each\nquestion.md's front matter in the Prototype, so every Board of that Prototype\nshares it? And agree the 12 SMS topic names (s05-D14).",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
