   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "s05 in one sentence: every level asks its own Questions, the Work that answers one names it, the report says the answer, open → partial → answered ①; the Report Space shows each row while /haipipe-report writes and checks it ②; and every theme groups them on one bar ③ ④.",
